{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/game.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;SLEEP TERROR&quot;</strong>  is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares. Travel through various places and dreams, explore and use the tools and items found on the board to make your escape easier. Game created by a single developer using Unreal Engine 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/gameplay.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744665023\" />In this game you can have fun, be scared and enjoy the atmosphere while looking for the exit on different maps. Look for ways to escape from the creatures and find a way out. Try to survive and just have fun. The game features various boards, from the well-known backrooms and poolrooms, but also something completely different, such as forest and wendigo gardens and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/Nowy_projekt.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ezgif-5b140c10cde0d7.gif?t=1744665023\" />There are many terrible maps you must overcome to get out of here. Explore and use the items included in the level to make your escape easier!\u00a0Keep your eyes peeled - Some maps contain creatures that have no friendly intentions towards you. There are also levels that involve chilling through the board (Poolrooms) with great, calm music in the background!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>The game also includes puzzles and mini games between levels.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/they.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/g.gif?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different creatures in different levels offer unique gameplay mechanics. Each monster will try to make the game difficult and scare you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/tools.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/tool.gif?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different levels offer different items that help you pass the level. Use flashlights, lamps, glow sticks, maps and other useful things to make your escape easier. Items are assigned to specific levels and their number of uses is infinite at this point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/vhs.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a BODYCAM-VHS filter that you can turn on with one click without even going to the settings!\u00a0This filter works best in Backrooms levels. It provides a great feeling of anxiety and emptiness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><i><strong>WISHLIST</strong></i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>BY ADDING THE GAME TO YOUR WISH LISTS, YOU SUPPORT MY PROJECT AND YOU WILL NOT MISS THE GAME PREMIERE!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/wish.gif?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2879710?t=1744665023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744665023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/d7ec83c8377c1a70aafb3b773e3bae73cca6d3f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744665023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/d7ec83c8377c1a70aafb3b773e3bae73cca6d3f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744665023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/game.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;SLEEP TERROR&quot;</strong>  is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares. Travel through various places and dreams, explore and use the tools and items found on the board to make your escape easier. Game created by a single developer using Unreal Engine 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/gameplay.png?t=1744665023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><